<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">&lt;Unsuccessful call&gt;</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">I hope this message finds you well. Regrettably, we weren't able to connect over the phone today, but I wanted to reach out and personally congratulate you on reaching Lifetime Platinum.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">&lt;Successful call&gt;</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Thanks again for speaking with me today. It was a pleasure to be able to congratulate you on attaining Lifetime Platinum.<br />
<br />
&lt;Email copy&gt;</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Lifetime Platinum is our most exclusive lifetime tier and is designed to recognise you for your incredible long-term loyalty to Qantas. For the rest of your travel journey, you will enjoy premium Platinum privileges every time you fly with us.</span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Key&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/status-and-clubs/status/lifetime-status.html">Lifetime Platinum Benefits</a>&nbsp;<span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">at a Glance:</span></span></strong></span></span>
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Complimentary access to Qantas International First and Domestic Business lounges.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">A 100% Status Bonus on eligible Qantas, Jetstar, and American Airlines flights.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Highest priority for international upgrades and Classic Flight Reward seating.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Advanced access to preferred seating zones.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black"><strong>Oneworld</strong>® Emerald privileges on eligible flights with Oneworld® airlines</span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"> </span></span><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Exclusive Access: The Qantas VIP Service Team</strong><br />
<br />
As a Lifetime Platinum member, you now have a direct line to the <strong>Qantas VIP Service Team</strong>. Available seven days a week between 7:00 AM and 11:00 PM (AEST), we are here to manage every aspect of your travel journey. In addition to handling routine bookings and upgrades, we will personally monitor your Qantas operated flights and seamlessly manage any flight disruptions on your behalf.<br />
<br />
You can find our dedicated contact details at the bottom of this email or by logging into your account online.<br />
<br />
Your unique Lifetime Platinum welcome pack and membership card are on their way to you. Please take a quick moment to review your profile settings and ensure your mailing address is up to date.<br />
<br />
Thank you once again for your extraordinary loyalty to Qantas and welcome to Qantas Lifetime Platinum.</span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:#222222">Kind Regards,</span></span><br />
